SUMMARY:Holiday Art & Makers Market
DESCRIPTION:Join us at Lorrimer Sanctuary for our VERY FIRST Art & Maker’s Market this holiday season! Looking for a unique shopping experience this holiday season? At Lorrimer Sanctuary we are hosting local artists and makers who are selling their handmade goods for one day only! You can buy yourself or a loved one nature-based artwork and other one-of-a kind gifts made with love! \nThis is an all ages event\, not a drop off program: children must have an accompanying adult if under 16 years old. \nFree entry – please register if you want to attend so we can get an idea of how many people to expect. \nCOST: FREE \nTicket sales for this event will end at 10:00 AM on the day of the event. \nInterested in becoming a member? Please click on the following link to learn more or join: Become a Member today! \nCANCELLATION: NJ Audubon’s programs require a minimum number of registrants to run. If we cancel\, due to lack of participation\, severe weather\, or unforeseen circumstances\, all participants will be notified as soon as possible and are eligible for a full refund. Participants may cancel without penalty if greater than 48 hours in advance. Sorry\, no refund for cancellations less than 48 hours in advance unless due to health emergencies; however\, registrations can be transferred to another program in the future. \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://njaudubon.org/event/holiday-art-makers-market/
LOCATION:Lorrimer Sanctuary\, 790 Ewing Avenue\, Franklin Lakes\, NJ\, 07417\, United States
CATEGORIES:Event,Family Program,Lorrimer Sanctuary
